  {
   "id": "lorn-s-lure-145858@major-2024-10-01",
   "gameId": "lorn-s-lure-145858",
   "displayName": "Another Smaller Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-10-01T03:48:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Had to make a smaller followup update after some issues were reported.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Full Run and Crystal Run achievements should now load :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 6 loading bug likely fixed (There was a case where the culling group did not trigger when scanning)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 8 path obstruction bug likely fixed (trigger logic changed to be consistent with saving checkpoint)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a slide in the chapter 8 tutorial area",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chapter 4 now correctly only has 4 scans vs 5",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Note that if you're in the middle of Chapter 6 or 8, you should restart the level to make sure these items are applied.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also there's an issue where settings reset when I update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'll try to solve this in a future update. But for now, don't put your headphones on, cause global audio maxes out :P",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
