  {
   "id": "lorn-s-lure-145858@major-2024-09-30",
   "gameId": "lorn-s-lure-145858",
   "displayName": "BIG Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-09-30T12:56:49.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's time for the first of many updates!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Bugs",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Achievements implementation fix. The achievements you should have gotten will now be populated on startup",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Invisible triggers should not kill you now",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Save progress should never be lost, even if you alt+f4",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some triggering volume logic. This affects levels loading properly (chapter 6 after the harvester). Waypoint hints may also be fixed. Chapter 8 path block may also be fixed. Please report if not with your save.dat and player.log file!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Not really a bug, but the community updated some dialogue in certain locales",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Control jank fixes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Standing next to a slide and jumping should not launch you off",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tic-Tacs had a minor change that may help improve reliability, but still thinking about this one",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "No more dying when touching a vertical wall at terminal velocity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Waste tunnel improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Death volume is now below sludge so it will feel more fair",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Flare light range has increased",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Flares last longer, so you can trace a path with them, or take your time platforming",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't allow looping back into start of caves once you've triggered the sludge flow",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chase segment sludge has been slowed down a bit",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Failed Biome improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Better teaching of Tic-Tac by having the tutorial appear right after getting it, and the exit being closer by",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Player cannot start the sky tram if they don't have the Mold Flower",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "There are now 3 paths to the mold flower, and underneath the island is visible from farther away to make it more obvious that you have to go under the island",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added some new checkpoints here and there",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Dissolution improvements",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added more platforms in area after the long fall",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added platforms in the area where you have to go upwards through a hole",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Second last section where you surf on the left: I cut off the top part since folks mistakenly went up",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Removed misleading path in the meat room",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Slowed down many sequences of meat and blocks",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Made it clearer that the block in the rotating checkered room kills you by changing the texture to glow-meat",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased the length of the starting area so that it better trains the player to use the grappling hook (also more fun to be had)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "I'm still looking for solutions to accommodate pure exploration players. Including a mode that simply stops the chases in the game. I just don't know how to do this for the last chapter for obvious reasons.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "I hope these changes at least ease the pains some of you have been having. I already have things in mind for the next update too, so stay tuned for more!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
